    <code code="10187-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Review of systems Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Tired in the mornings; weight steady</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No palpitations, chest pain, or fainting</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Vomiting after binges seven times this week; no blood in the vomit; no abdominal pain</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cramps or weakness</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Low mood and hopelessness, a little better; no thoughts of suicide or self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

