    <text><paragraph>Vital signs recorded on 1990-02-16; see the Vital Signs section. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>General</td><td>Well; weight 61.2 kg, BMI 19.3; lying blood pressure 104/66 and pulse 68, standing 100/64 and pulse 84 after three minutes</td></tr><tr><td>Head and neck</td><td>Both parotid glands enlarged and non-tender, as before; enamel erosion on the inner surfaces of the upper front teeth</td></tr><tr><td>Skin</td><td>Small calluses on the backs of two knuckles of the right hand</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Tearful at times but engaged; organized; no psychotic features; insight good</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

